  - characterName:
    - Lola Remy
    - Lola Remy
    - Rafael
    - Lola Remy
    - Rafael
    - Lola Remy
    - Lola Remy
    - Lola Remy
    - Javier
    - Lola Remy
    - Javier
    - Lola Remy
    - Rafael
    - Lola Remy
    dialog:
    - Good morning, hijos, the mess is fine. I am Remedios but you may call me Lola
      Remy.
    - You see.... I'm here because my apo and her friends went missing a week ago.
    - Missing
    - Yes. They went to Cagayan de Oro to go camping and then they never returned.
    - Have you gone to someone else about this ma'am?
    - Yes, and they told me that maybe the kids got into an accident or did something
      they shouldn't have.
    - I don't have a concrete evidence but, I believe that something happened to
      them on that campsite....
    - That's why I came to your agency because I heard that you were experts in matters
      like this.
    - Do you have any more information ma'am..
    - I only have their pictures and the location of their campsite...
    - Don't worry ma'am. Those are enough.
    - Please help me find them .... or at the very least know what happened...
    - Leave it to us, lola.
    - Goodbye.
    endAfterDialog: 0
    nextDialog: 5
